{"id":"u37","kelas":11,"no":3,"judul":"Eksposisi Hortatori","title":"Hortatory Exposition","emoji":"📢","ringkas":"Mengajak dan menyarankan dengan alasan","ready":true,"goals":["memahami tujuan **hortatory exposition**: meyakinkan pembaca bahwa suatu hal **seharusnya** atau **tidak seharusnya** dilakukan (*ought to be the case*)","mengenali struktur: **Thesis**, **Arguments**, dan **Recommendation**","membedakan hortatory dengan analytical exposition","memakai modal [[should]], [[must]], [[ought to]], [[had better]] untuk saran dan ajakan","memakai ungkapan saran: [[I suggest that ...]], [[It is important to ...]], [[Let's ...]]","menulis teks hortatory singkat yang meyakinkan"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Di unit 36 kamu belajar meyakinkan pembaca bahwa sesuatu **memang demikian**. Sekarang kamu meyakinkan pembaca untuk **bertindak**: kita *seharusnya* menghemat air, *seharusnya* tidak membuang sampah sembarangan. Itulah **hortatory exposition**, teks yang sering dipakai dalam kampanye, pidato, dan opini."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Analytical vs hortatory","table":[["","Analytical exposition","Hortatory exposition"],["**Tujuan**","meyakinkan bahwa sesuatu *memang demikian*","meyakinkan bahwa sesuatu *seharusnya dilakukan*"],["**Struktur**","Thesis, Arguments, Reiteration","Thesis, Arguments, **Recommendation**"],["**Penutup**","menegaskan ulang pendapat","memberi saran atau ajakan"],["**Contoh thesis**","[[Smoking is harmful.]]","[[People should not smoke in public places.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Struktur hortatory exposition","table":[["Bagian","Fungsi","Contoh"],["**Thesis**","pendapat tentang apa yang seharusnya terjadi","[[We should save water.]]"],["**Arguments**","alasan mengapa hal itu perlu","[[Firstly, clean water is limited.]]"],["**Recommendation**","saran atau ajakan bertindak","[[Therefore, let's turn off the tap when we brush our teeth.]]"]]},{"t":"vocab","title":"3. Kosakata penting","items":[{"en":"recommendation","id":"rekomendasi / saran","ex":"The last paragraph gives a recommendation."},{"en":"suggest","id":"menyarankan","ex":"I suggest that you sleep early."},{"en":"urge","id":"mendesak / mengimbau","ex":"The teacher urges students to read."},{"en":"encourage","id":"mendorong","ex":"Parents encourage children to study."},{"en":"avoid","id":"menghindari","ex":"We should avoid fast food."},{"en":"prevent","id":"mencegah","ex":"Exercise prevents many diseases."},{"en":"campaign","id":"kampanye","ex":"The school has a clean-up campaign."},{"en":"habit","id":"kebiasaan","ex":"Reading is a good habit."},{"en":"waste","id":"sampah / memboroskan","ex":"Don't waste water."},{"en":"litter","id":"sampah berserakan / membuang sampah sembarangan","ex":"Please don't litter."},{"en":"protect","id":"melindungi","ex":"Trees protect us from the sun."},{"en":"responsible","id":"bertanggung jawab","ex":"We are responsible for our planet."},{"en":"community","id":"komunitas / lingkungan masyarakat","ex":"Our community cleans the river."},{"en":"action","id":"tindakan","ex":"We must take action now."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. Modal untuk saran dan kewajiban","table":[["Modal","Kekuatan","Contoh"],["**can / could**","saran ringan","[[You could ride a bike to school.]]"],["**should / ought to**","saran kuat","[[We should reduce plastic.]] / [[We ought to protect the sea.]]"],["**had better**","saran dengan peringatan","[[You had better stop littering.]]"],["**must**","kewajiban kuat","[[We must save the forests.]]"],["**should not / must not**","larangan","[[We should not waste food.]] / [[You must not litter.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. Ungkapan saran dan ajakan","table":[["Ungkapan","Contoh"],["[[I suggest that + subjek + kata kerja dasar]]","[[I suggest that everyone bring a bottle.]]"],["[[It is important to + kata kerja]]","[[It is important to keep the river clean.]]"],["[[It is time to + kata kerja]]","[[It is time to change our habits.]]"],["[[Let's + kata kerja dasar]]","[[Let's plant a tree.]]"],["[[We need to + kata kerja]]","[[We need to act now.]]"],["[[Why don't we + kata kerja dasar?]]","[[Why don't we start today?]]"]]},{"t":"warn","title":"Setelah suggest","text":"Setelah [[I suggest that]], kata kerja memakai **bentuk dasar**, tanpa -s: [[I suggest that he **study** harder.]] (bukan *studies*). Setelah [[should]] dan [[must]] pun kata kerja bentuk dasar."},{"t":"dialog","title":"Teks 1: Let's Keep Our River Clean","lines":[{"who":"Text","en":"Rivers are important for our lives, so we should keep them clean. Today, many rivers are full of rubbish.","id":"Sungai penting bagi hidup kita, jadi kita seharusnya menjaganya tetap bersih. Kini banyak sungai penuh sampah."},{"who":"Text","en":"Firstly, dirty water makes people sick. Secondly, rubbish blocks the water and can cause floods. Moreover, fish and other animals die because of the pollution.","id":"Pertama, air kotor membuat orang sakit. Kedua, sampah menyumbat air dan dapat menyebabkan banjir. Selain itu, ikan dan hewan lain mati karena pencemaran."},{"who":"Text","en":"Therefore, we must not throw rubbish into the river. I suggest that every family put its rubbish in a bin. Let's also clean the river together every month.","id":"Oleh karena itu, kita tidak boleh membuang sampah ke sungai. Saya menyarankan setiap keluarga membuang sampah ke tempat sampah. Mari juga membersihkan sungai bersama setiap bulan."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Merencanakan kampanye","lines":[{"who":"Dina","en":"Our school should have a plastic-free campaign.","id":"Sekolah kita seharusnya punya kampanye bebas plastik."},{"who":"Budi","en":"Why? Is plastic really a problem?","id":"Mengapa? Apakah plastik benar-benar masalah?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"Yes. Plastic takes hundreds of years to decay and it harms sea animals.","id":"Ya. Plastik butuh ratusan tahun untuk terurai dan membahayakan hewan laut."},{"who":"Budi","en":"I see. I suggest that every student bring a drinking bottle.","id":"Aku paham. Aku menyarankan setiap siswa membawa botol minum."},{"who":"Dina","en":"Great idea. Let's tell Ms. Sari about it.","id":"Ide bagus. Mari kita sampaikan kepada Ms. Sari."}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Menulis recommendation yang kuat","text":"Akhiri teks dengan saran yang **jelas dan bisa dilakukan**: siapa melakukan apa. Lebih baik [[Every student should bring a bottle.]] daripada [[We should do something.]] Gunakan [[Therefore]], [[So]], atau [[Let's]] di awal."},{"t":"summary","items":["Hortatory exposition = meyakinkan pembaca bahwa sesuatu **seharusnya dilakukan**.","Struktur: **Thesis → Arguments → Recommendation**.","Modal: [[should]], [[ought to]], [[must]], [[had better]]; larangan: [[should not]], [[must not]].","Saran: [[I suggest that ...]], [[It is important to ...]], [[Let's ...]].","Beda dengan analytical: penutupnya **saran/ajakan**, bukan sekadar penegasan ulang."]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kosakata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["recommendation","saran"],["suggest","menyarankan"],["avoid","menghindari"],["prevent","mencegah"],["protect","melindungi"]],"exp":"Kosakata dasar hortatory.","k":"d5671295"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kosakata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["campaign","kampanye"],["habit","kebiasaan"],["responsible","bertanggung jawab"],["community","komunitas"]],"exp":"Kosakata kampanye.","k":"dd0f5ad1"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan bagian teks dengan fungsinya:","pairs":[["Thesis","pendapat tentang yang seharusnya"],["Arguments","alasan"],["Recommendation","saran atau ajakan"]],"exp":"Tiga bagian hortatory exposition.","k":"1b0c07fb"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Tujuan hortatory exposition adalah...","options":["meyakinkan pembaca agar bertindak","menceritakan pengalaman","menjelaskan cara memasak","mengundang ke pesta"],"answer":0,"exp":"Hortatory mengajak pembaca bertindak.","k":"2359a746"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bagian penutup hortatory exposition disebut...","options":["recommendation","reiteration","orientation","resolution"],"answer":0,"exp":"Recommendation = saran/ajakan.","k":"cad8a3b2"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang paling cocok sebagai thesis hortatory?","options":["People should not litter.","Litter is rubbish.","Rubbish is on the road.","I saw litter yesterday."],"answer":0,"exp":"Thesis hortatory memakai should.","k":"71fa752a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Modal yang menyatakan kewajiban kuat adalah...","options":["must","could","may","might"],"answer":0,"exp":"must = harus.","k":"b9144438"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Modal yang menyatakan saran dengan peringatan adalah...","options":["had better","can","will","would"],"answer":0,"exp":"had better = sebaiknya (kalau tidak, ada akibat).","k":"fe3f1770"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat yang benar adalah...","options":["I suggest that he study harder.","I suggest that he studies harder.","I suggest that he studying harder.","I suggest that he to study harder."],"answer":0,"exp":"suggest that + subjek + kata kerja dasar.","k":"42d119dc"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat yang benar adalah...","options":["We should not waste water.","We should not wasting water.","We should not wastes water.","We not should waste water."],"answer":0,"exp":"should not + kata kerja dasar.","k":"ec51552a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Ajakan yang tepat adalah...","options":["Let's plant a tree.","Let's planting a tree.","Let's plants a tree.","Let's to plant a tree."],"answer":0,"exp":"Let's + kata kerja dasar.","k":"342605fd"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata yang tepat: \"It is important ___ keep the river clean.\"","options":["to","for","of","with"],"answer":0,"exp":"It is important to + kata kerja.","k":"c7acb96c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Teks \"Firstly ... Secondly ... Therefore, let's ...\" termasuk teks...","options":["hortatory exposition","recount","procedure","announcement"],"answer":0,"exp":"Diakhiri ajakan bertindak.","k":"f41c4e15"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kita seharusnya menghemat listrik.","q":"We ___ save electricity.","answers":["should","must","ought to"],"hint":"modal","exp":"should + kata kerja dasar.","k":"b3706669"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kita sebaiknya melindungi laut.","q":"We ought ___ protect the sea.","answers":["to"],"hint":"ought ...","exp":"ought to + kata kerja dasar.","k":"e0be729a"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kamu tidak boleh membuang sampah sembarangan.","q":"You must ___ litter.","answers":["not"],"hint":"negatif","exp":"must not = dilarang.","k":"4a1ce397"},{"type":"fill","id":"Sudah waktunya mengubah kebiasaan kita.","q":"It is ___ to change our habits.","answers":["time"],"hint":"waktu","exp":"It is time to + kata kerja.","k":"9048e043"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mari kita mulai hari ini.","q":"___ start today.","answers":["let's","Let's"],"hint":"ajakan","exp":"Let's + kata kerja dasar.","k":"884eab74"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Kita harus melindungi hutan.\"","answer":"We must protect the forests.","exp":"must + kata kerja dasar.","k":"d218a738"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Aku menyarankan agar semua siswa membawa botol.\"","answer":"I suggest that all students bring a bottle.","exp":"suggest that + subjek + kata kerja dasar.","k":"df0966c4"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"We should not waste water","options":["Kita tidak seharusnya memboroskan air","Kita harus membeli air","Air itu bersih","Kami minum air"],"answer":0,"exp":"should not = seharusnya tidak.","k":"da00eb51"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Let us clean the river together","options":["Mari membersihkan sungai bersama","Sungai itu kotor","Aku tidak mau membersihkan","Sungai itu jauh"],"answer":0,"exp":"Let us = mari kita.","k":"b85d0c3d"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"It is important to protect the environment","options":["Penting untuk melindungi lingkungan","Lingkungan itu besar","Aku suka lingkungan baru","Lingkungan sedang dibangun"],"answer":0,"exp":"It is important to = penting untuk.","k":"f43719c1"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kita sebaiknya menghindari makanan cepat saji.","q":"We should ___ fast food. (avoid)","answers":["avoid"],"hint":"menghindari","exp":"avoid = menghindari.","k":"62d5e2e7"},{"type":"fill","id":"Orang tua mendorong anak-anak belajar.","q":"Parents ___ children to study.","answers":["encourage"],"hint":"mendorong","exp":"encourage + objek + to.","k":"0d548449"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kita semua bertanggung jawab atas bumi.","q":"We are all ___ for the earth.","answers":["responsible"],"hint":"bertanggung jawab","exp":"responsible for = bertanggung jawab atas.","k":"77fc9623"},{"type":"fill","id":"Sebaiknya kamu berhenti merokok.","q":"You had ___ stop smoking.","answers":["better"],"hint":"had ...","exp":"had better + kata kerja dasar.","k":"4fd8f29d"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mengapa kita tidak mulai sekarang?","q":"Why ___ we start now?","answers":["don't"],"hint":"negatif","exp":"Why don't we + kata kerja dasar?","k":"e4eafc73"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kita perlu bertindak sekarang.","q":"We ___ to act now.","answers":["need"],"hint":"perlu","exp":"We need to + kata kerja.","k":"e14b8894"},{"type":"fill","id":"Jangan membuang makanan.","q":"Don't ___ food. (waste)","answers":["waste"],"hint":"memboroskan","exp":"waste = memboroskan.","k":"1dcd23eb"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pohon melindungi kita dari panas.","q":"Trees ___ us from the heat. (protect)","answers":["protect"],"hint":"melindungi","exp":"Subjek jamak, tanpa -s.","k":"e6ef54e5"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia menyarankan agar kami menanam pohon.","q":"She suggests that we ___ trees. (plant)","answers":["plant"],"hint":"bentuk dasar","exp":"suggest that + kata kerja dasar.","k":"b6460cf6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang termasuk saran paling kuat?","options":["You must wear a helmet.","You could wear a helmet.","You may wear a helmet.","You might wear a helmet."],"answer":0,"exp":"must = kewajiban kuat.","k":"156fb594"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang merupakan larangan?","options":["You must not park here.","You can park here.","You may park here.","You should park here."],"answer":0,"exp":"must not = dilarang.","k":"38149a50"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang paling cocok sebagai recommendation?","options":["So, every student should bring a reusable bottle.","Plastic is made from oil.","Firstly, plastic harms animals.","I saw plastic yesterday."],"answer":0,"exp":"Saran yang jelas di akhir teks.","k":"ff39a49d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang paling cocok sebagai argumen?","options":["Smoke from cigarettes makes other people sick.","Do not smoke.","Let's stop smoking.","I suggest that you quit."],"answer":0,"exp":"Argumen berisi alasan atau akibat.","k":"248ab421"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Thesis hortatory yang baik adalah...","options":["Students should eat breakfast every day.","Breakfast is at seven.","I ate rice.","Breakfast was good."],"answer":0,"exp":"Thesis menyatakan yang seharusnya dilakukan.","k":"fb6e552d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat \"It is time to change our habits.\" artinya...","options":["sudah waktunya mengubah kebiasaan kita","waktu itu mahal","kebiasaan kita bagus","kami tidak punya waktu"],"answer":0,"exp":"It is time to = sudah waktunya.","k":"3f54d99d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang benar?","options":["People ought to respect others.","People ought respect others.","People ought to respecting others.","People oughts to respect others."],"answer":0,"exp":"ought to + kata kerja dasar.","k":"8d6ac8bf"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang benar?","options":["We had better leave now.","We had better to leave now.","We had better leaving now.","We better had leave now."],"answer":0,"exp":"had better + kata kerja dasar.","k":"c91d7369"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Teks mana yang paling mungkin hortatory exposition?","options":["Let's stop wasting food, because many people are hungry.","Yesterday I went to the market.","Mix the flour and the eggs.","The party starts at four."],"answer":0,"exp":"Ajakan dengan alasan.","k":"a78bdb46"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"urge\" paling dekat artinya dengan...","options":["mendesak","melarang","menolak","meminjam"],"answer":0,"exp":"urge = mendesak/mengimbau.","k":"d78f622a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"campaign\" paling dekat artinya dengan...","options":["kampanye","kompetisi","kelas","pesta"],"answer":0,"exp":"campaign = kampanye.","k":"ea14aa65"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Kita seharusnya tidak memboroskan makanan.\"","answer":"We should not waste food.","exp":"should not + kata kerja dasar.","k":"554208f8"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan ungkapan dengan fungsinya:","pairs":[["Let's ...","ajakan"],["I suggest that ...","saran"],["You must not ...","larangan"],["It is time to ...","mengingatkan perlunya bertindak"]],"exp":"Fungsi ungkapan saran.","k":"d9e0f5da"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"You had better stop littering","options":["Sebaiknya kamu berhenti membuang sampah sembarangan","Kamu suka sampah","Kamu membersihkan kamar","Sampah itu hilang"],"answer":0,"exp":"had better = sebaiknya.","k":"637a2835"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Why do not we start today","options":["Mengapa kita tidak mulai hari ini","Kita mulai kemarin","Aku tidak mau mulai","Hari ini libur"],"answer":0,"exp":"Why don't we = mengapa kita tidak (ajakan).","k":"aa2add2a"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kita seharusnya menjaga kebersihan sungai.","q":"We ___ keep the river clean.","answers":["should"],"hint":"seharusnya","exp":"should.","k":"77fa9a23"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pemerintah perlu membuat aturan baru.","q":"The government ___ to make new rules.","answers":["needs"],"hint":"perlu","exp":"needs to.","k":"a8167748"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kami menyarankan agar siswa membaca setiap hari.","q":"We ___ that students read every day.","answers":["recommend","suggest"],"hint":"menyarankan","exp":"recommend.","k":"1edfe82f"},{"type":"fill","id":"Sebaiknya kita tidak membuang sampah sembarangan.","q":"We ___ not litter.","answers":["should"],"hint":"sebaiknya","exp":"should not.","k":"b816c6bb"},{"type":"fill","id":"Setiap orang harus ikut serta.","q":"Everyone ___ take part.","answers":["must"],"hint":"harus","exp":"must.","k":"723fab10"},{"type":"fill","id":"Jadi, mari kita lakukan sekarang.","q":"So, ___ us act now.","answers":["let"],"hint":"mari","exp":"Let us.","k":"9289b20b"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mengurangi sampah itu penting.","q":"Reducing waste is ___.","answers":["important"],"hint":"penting","exp":"important.","k":"d336156b"},{"type":"fill","id":"Hutan penting bagi kehidupan.","q":"Forests are ___ for life.","answers":["vital","important","essential"],"hint":"penting","exp":"vital.","k":"ab0ee766"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kita harus bertindak sebelum terlambat.","q":"We must act ___ it is too late.","answers":["before"],"hint":"sebelum","exp":"before.","k":"bdcc2b3e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Tujuan hortatory exposition:","options":["membujuk pembaca melakukan sesuatu","menceritakan masa lalu","menjelaskan proses alam","menggambarkan orang"],"answer":0,"exp":"Membujuk bertindak.","k":"31987782"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Struktur hortatory exposition:","options":["thesis – arguments – recommendation","orientation – events","goal – steps","title – description"],"answer":0,"exp":"Ada recommendation.","k":"0318670a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Recommendation berisi...","options":["saran/ajakan bertindak","tokoh","resep","daftar harga"],"answer":0,"exp":"Saran.","k":"bdaf350a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Modal yang cocok untuk saran: ___","options":["should","did","was","had"],"answer":0,"exp":"should.","k":"1d64cf12"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"It is necessary to ...\" artinya...","options":["perlu untuk ...","tidak mungkin ...","dilarang ...","mudah untuk ..."],"answer":0,"exp":"necessary.","k":"d722601f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"We ought to recycle\" artinya...","options":["Kita sebaiknya mendaur ulang","Kita tidak boleh","Kita telah mendaur ulang","Kita sedang mendaur ulang"],"answer":0,"exp":"ought to.","k":"a5c04827"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang benar?","options":["We should to protect the sea.","We should protect the sea.","We